---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const moments = [
	{ src: '/travel/hobbiton.jpg', place: 'Hobbiton', note: 'Matamata, New Zealand', class: 'wide' },
	{ src: '/travel/paris.jpg', place: 'Paris', note: 'France', class: 'portrait' },
	{ src: '/travel/chichen-itza.jpg', place: 'A friend and a TARDIS', note: 'Disney World · Orlando', class: 'portrait' },
	{ src: '/travel/mirror.jpg', place: 'Through the looking glass', note: 'Finding strange rooms everywhere', class: 'tall' },
];

const hexCells = Array.from({ length: 24 });
---

<Layout
	title="Beyond Code | Elijah Schoneweis"
	description="A personal travel journal from Elijah Schoneweis: six months abroad through Japan, Australia, Mexico, and beyond."
	theme="eva"
>
	<div class="travel-shell">
		<div class="field-rail" aria-hidden="true"><strong>ES</strong><span>FIELD OPERATIONS ARCHIVE // 2024</span><i>RECORD STATUS: OPEN</i></div>
		<header class="nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
			<a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Elijah Schoneweis, portfolio home">
				<span class="mark"><img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89532300?v=4" alt="" width="37" height="37" /></span>
				<span class="wordmark-text">E. Schoneweis // Field Records</span>
			</a>
			<nav>
				<a href="/">Portfolio</a>
				<a href="#japan">Japan</a>
				<a href="#diving">Diving</a>
				<a class="instagram" href="https://www.instagram.com/mister_e.42/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram <span>↗</span></a>
			</nav>
		</header>
		<div class="warning-tape" aria-hidden="true"><span>EXTERNAL OPERATIONS</span><i></i><span>ARCHIVE 2024</span><i></i><span>ROUTE DATA VERIFIED</span><i></i><span>FIELD UNIT ES</span></div>

		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="hero-photo">
					<img src="/travel/jungle.jpg" alt="Elijah looking across a forested mountain landscape" width="1800" height="1350" fetchpriority="high" />
					<div class="travel-hex-field" aria-hidden="true">{hexCells.map(() => <span></span>)}</div>
					<div class="field-classification" aria-hidden="true"><span>外部</span><div><strong>EXTERNAL</strong><small>FIELD OBSERVATION RECORD</small></div></div>
					<div class="coordinates">40°45' N / 73°59' W</div>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-title">
					<p class="kicker"><span></span> External operations · Field notes 2024</p>
					<p class="hero-code" aria-hidden="true">記録 // 移動 // 発見</p>
					<h1>The long way<br /><em>forward.</em></h1>
					<p class="dek">Six months, a standby pass, and a decision to see what was beyond the next departure gate.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-stats" aria-label="Travel summary">
					<div><strong>06</strong><span>months moving</span></div>
					<div><strong>03</strong><span>defining chapters</span></div>
					<div><strong>AOW</strong><span>scuba certified</span></div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="origin" aria-labelledby="origin-title">
				<div class="origin-label">
					<p>00 / Why I went</p>
					<span>Lincoln, NE → Everywhere</span>
				</div>
				<div class="origin-copy">
					<h2 id="origin-title">At the end of 2023, I was moving through one of the hardest periods of my life.</h2>
					<p class="lead">A six-month standby flight pass gave me an unexpected way forward: somewhere to go, a reason to stay curious, and room to find my footing again.</p>
					<div class="columns">
						<p>For the first six months of 2024, I traveled. Not to check countries off a list, but to be present in places completely unlike home: navigating Tokyo, living aboard a dive boat off Cairns, descending into Mexican cenotes, and learning to be comfortable with plans that changed by the hour.</p>
						<p>Travel did not resolve everything I was carrying. It did make my world larger. It taught me to adapt quickly, ask better questions, and accept that the most worthwhile experiences rarely arrive on a predictable schedule.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<figure class="origin-image">
					<img src="/travel/mirror.jpg" alt="Elijah reflected repeatedly in a blue mirrored installation" width="1350" height="1800" />
					<figcaption><span>001</span> A different angle changes everything.</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</section>

			<div class="route" aria-label="Selected route">
				<span>Lincoln</span><i></i><span>Tokyo</span><i></i><span>Kyoto</span><i></i><span>Osaka</span><i></i><span>Cairns</span><i></i><span>Yucatán</span>
			</div>

			<section class="chapter japan" id="japan" aria-labelledby="japan-title">
				<div class="chapter-heading">
					<p>01 / Japan</p>
					<div>
						<h2 id="japan-title">The place I kept<br /><em>coming back to.</em></h2>
						<p>Japan became the center of those six months: equal parts old and new, quiet and electric. My usual route began in Tokyo, continued by Shinkansen to Kyoto, and ended in Osaka. I went for the food, design, history, games, and animation. I kept returning because every stop made the familiar feel new again.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="japan-grid">
					<figure class="golden">
						<img src="/travel/kinkakuji.jpg" alt="Elijah at Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion in Kyoto" width="1350" height="1800" />
						<figcaption><strong>Kyoto</strong><span>Kinkaku-ji · Golden Pavilion</span></figcaption>
					</figure>
					<figure class="gundam">
						<img src="/travel/gundam.jpg" alt="Elijah in front of the life-size Unicorn Gundam in Tokyo" width="1350" height="1800" />
						<figcaption><strong>Tokyo</strong><span>Unicorn Gundam · Odaiba</span></figcaption>
					</figure>
					<figure class="eva">
						<img src="/travel/evangelion.jpg" alt="Elijah at the Evangelion thirtieth anniversary exhibition" width="1800" height="1350" />
						<figcaption><strong>Tokyo</strong><span>Evangelion · 30th anniversary</span></figcaption>
					</figure>
				</div>
				<div class="city-sequence" aria-label="Typical Japan route">
					<article>
						<img src="/travel/akihabara.jpg" alt="Elijah walking through Akihabara in Tokyo" width="1350" height="1800" loading="lazy" />
						<div><span>01</span><strong>Tokyo</strong><small>Start in Akihabara</small></div>
					</article>
					<i aria-hidden="true">新幹線</i>
					<article>
						<img src="/travel/fushimi-inari.jpg" alt="The torii paths at Fushimi Inari in Kyoto" width="1350" height="1800" loading="lazy" />
						<div><span>02</span><strong>Kyoto</strong><small>Fushimi Inari</small></div>
					</article>
					<i aria-hidden="true">新幹線</i>
					<article>
						<img src="/travel/usj-entrance.jpg" alt="Elijah at the entrance to Super Nintendo World at Universal Studios Japan" width="1350" height="1800" loading="lazy" />
						<div><span>03</span><strong>Osaka</strong><small>Universal Studios Japan</small></div>
					</article>
				</div>
				<div class="osaka-feature">
					<div class="osaka-copy">
						<p>Osaka / USJ</p>
						<h3>Stepping into the games I grew up with.</h3>
						<span>Super Nintendo World turns level design into a physical place: paths, sightlines, sound cues, hidden details, and question blocks included.</span>
					</div>
					<figure>
						<img src="/travel/usj-mushroom-kingdom.jpg" alt="Elijah inside the Mushroom Kingdom at Super Nintendo World" width="1350" height="1800" loading="lazy" />
					</figure>
					<figure>
						<img src="/travel/usj-question-block.jpg" alt="Elijah seated beneath a glowing question block at Super Nintendo World" width="1350" height="1800" loading="lazy" />
					</figure>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="chapter ocean" id="diving" aria-labelledby="ocean-title">
				<div class="ocean-image">
					<img src="/travel/scuba.jpg" alt="Elijah scuba diving in open blue water off Cairns" width="1800" height="1350" />
					<span class="depth">DESCENT // 18 M</span>
				</div>
				<div class="ocean-copy">
					<p class="chapter-index">02 / Australia</p>
					<h2 id="ocean-title">Three days<br />off the <em>grid.</em></h2>
					<p class="lead">I lived aboard a dive boat for three days off the coast of Cairns and earned my Advanced Open Water certification.</p>
					<p>Life narrowed to weather, equipment checks, meals with strangers, and the next descent. Underwater, communication becomes deliberate and every decision has a consequence. It is one of the clearest places I know.</p>
					<div class="dive-facts">
						<div><strong>3</strong><span>days liveaboard</span></div>
						<div><strong>AOW</strong><span>certification earned</span></div>
						<div><strong>∞</strong><span>reasons to return</span></div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="chapter mexico" aria-labelledby="mexico-title">
				<div class="mexico-copy">
					<p class="chapter-index">03 / Mexico</p>
					<h2 id="mexico-title">History above.<br /><em>Another world below.</em></h2>
					<p>I traveled to the Yucatán to stand beneath Chichén Itzá and dive the cenotes: freshwater caverns where sunlight cuts through clear water into chambers below the jungle. One journey held both the scale of human history and the quiet of a place hidden underground.</p>
				</div>
				<figure>
					<img src="/travel/times-square.jpg" alt="Elijah at El Castillo in Chichén Itzá, Mexico" width="1350" height="1800" />
					<figcaption><span>20.6843° N</span><span>88.5678° W</span></figcaption>
				</figure>
			</section>

			<section class="curiosity" aria-labelledby="curiosity-title">
				<div class="curiosity-heading">
					<p>04 / The rest of the map</p>
					<h2 id="curiosity-title">Curiosity is the<br />common thread.</h2>
					<p>Travel, scuba, science fiction, Lego, games, and software all begin the same way for me: wanting to know what is inside, underneath, or around the next corner.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="moment-grid">
					{moments.map((moment, index) => (
						<figure class={moment.class}>
							<img src={moment.src} alt={`${moment.place}, ${moment.note}`} width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" />
							<figcaption><span>0{index + 1}</span><div><strong>{moment.place}</strong><small>{moment.note}</small></div></figcaption>
						</figure>
					))}
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="next" aria-labelledby="next-title">
				<p>There is always another departure board.</p>
				<h2 id="next-title">Still moving.<br /><em>Still curious.</em></h2>
				<div class="next-links">
					<a href="/">Return to the work <span>↗</span></a>
					<a href="https://www.instagram.com/mister_e.42/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Follow the next trip <span>↗</span></a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer><span>© 2026 Elijah Schoneweis</span><span>FIELD NOTES // 2024—PRESENT</span></footer>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(:root) {
		--night: #0a1012;
		--paper: #e9e4d8;
		--paper-dark: #c5bfb2;
		--ink: #11181a;
		--white: #f2f2ec;
		--orange: #ff6d3d;
		--sky: #7fd5e3;
		--line: rgba(240, 242, 236, 0.16);
		--display: 'Syne', sans-serif;
		--mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
	}

	.travel-shell { overflow: hidden; background: var(--night); color: var(--white); }
	.nav { position: absolute; z-index: 20; top: 0; left: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: min(1400px, calc(100% - 96px)); padding: 28px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); transform: translateX(-50%); }
	.wordmark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; text-decoration: none; }
	.mark { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 37px; height: 37px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--orange); color: var(--orange); font: 500 11px var(--mono); clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px); }
	.mark img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
	.wordmark-text { font: 600 15px var(--display); }
	.nav nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }
	.nav nav a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.76); font: 500 10px var(--mono); text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .09em; }
	.nav nav a:hover { color: #fff; }
	.nav .instagram { padding: 11px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); color: #fff; }
	.instagram span { color: var(--orange); }

	.hero { position: relative; min-height: 100vh; background: #101719; }
	.hero-photo { position: absolute; inset: 0 0 0 42%; overflow: hidden; }
	.hero-photo::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #101719 0%, transparent 34%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(5,8,9,.68), transparent 42%); }
	.hero-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 58%; filter: saturate(.82) contrast(1.06); }
	.coordinates { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: 28px; bottom: 26px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); font: 400 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .12em; }
	.hero-title { position: relative; z-index: 3; width: min(1400px, calc(100% - 96px)); margin: 0 auto; padding-top: clamp(190px, 24vh, 280px); }
	.kicker { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); font: 500 10px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; }
	.kicker span { width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--orange); }
	h1 { max-width: 900px; margin: 25px 0 26px; font: 600 clamp(66px, 8vw, 126px)/.87 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.07em; }
	h1 em, .chapter h2 em, .next h2 em { color: var(--orange); font-style: normal; }
	.dek { max-width: 525px; margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.73); font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px); line-height: 1.7; }
	.hero-stats { position: absolute; z-index: 3; bottom: 43px; left: max(48px, calc((100% - 1400px) / 2)); display: flex; gap: 48px; }
	.hero-stats div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
	.hero-stats strong { color: var(--orange); font: 600 26px var(--display); }
	.hero-stats span { max-width: 74px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); font: 400 8px/1.4 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }

	.origin { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .65fr 1.5fr .9fr; gap: clamp(35px, 6vw, 100px); width: min(1400px, calc(100% - 96px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 150px 0; }
	.origin-label p, .chapter-heading > p, .chapter-index, .curiosity-heading > p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--orange); font: 500 9px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .11em; }
	.origin-label span { color: #667478; font: 400 9px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
	.origin-copy h2 { margin: 0 0 38px; font: 600 clamp(35px, 4vw, 60px)/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.05em; }
	.origin-copy .lead { margin: 0 0 35px; color: #d3dcdd; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.75; }
	.columns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 35px; }
	.columns p { margin: 0; color: #87969a; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; }
	.origin-image { align-self: end; margin: 0; }
	.origin-image img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 480px; object-fit: cover; }
	.origin-image figcaption { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 12px; color: #748286; font: 400 9px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
	.origin-image figcaption span { color: var(--orange); }

	.route { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: min(1400px, calc(100% - 96px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: #7d8a8d; font: 400 9px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; }
	.route i { flex: 1; max-width: 120px; height: 1px; margin: 0 18px; background: #344044; }
	.route i::after { content: ''; display: block; width: 5px; height: 5px; margin: -2px auto 0; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); }

	.chapter { width: min(1400px, calc(100% - 96px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 150px 0; }
	.chapter-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .65fr 2.4fr; gap: 60px; margin-bottom: 80px; }
	.chapter-heading > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr .75fr; gap: 75px; align-items: end; }
	.chapter h2 { margin: 0; font: 600 clamp(50px, 6vw, 90px)/.97 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.065em; }
	.chapter-heading > div > p, .mexico-copy > p:last-child { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #89979a; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
	.japan-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .72fr; grid-template-rows: 530px 330px; gap: 18px; }
	.japan-grid figure { position: relative; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; background: #151d20; }
	.japan-grid .golden { grid-row: 1 / 3; }
	.japan-grid img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 700ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
	.japan-grid figure:hover img, .moment-grid figure:hover img { transform: scale(1.025); }
	.japan-grid .golden img { object-position: 50% 43%; }
	.japan-grid .gundam img { object-position: 50% 36%; }
	.japan-grid .eva img { object-position: 50% 49%; }
	.japan-grid figcaption { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; padding: 55px 22px 20px; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(4,7,8,.88)); }
	.japan-grid figcaption strong { font: 600 20px var(--display); }
	.japan-grid figcaption span { color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); font: 400 8px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
	.city-sequence { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 60px 1fr 60px 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: center; margin-top: 70px; }
	.city-sequence article { position: relative; height: 430px; overflow: hidden; background: #151d20; }
	.city-sequence article::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 45% 0 0; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(4,7,8,.9)); }
	.city-sequence img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
	.city-sequence article:nth-of-type(1) img { object-position: 50% 55%; }
	.city-sequence article:nth-of-type(2) img { object-position: 50% 50%; }
	.city-sequence article:nth-of-type(3) img { object-position: 50% 42%; }
	.city-sequence article div { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: 18px; bottom: 18px; left: 18px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 3px 12px; align-items: center; }
	.city-sequence article span { grid-row: 1 / 3; color: var(--orange); font: 400 9px var(--mono); }
	.city-sequence article strong { font: 600 20px var(--display); }
	.city-sequence article small { color: rgba(255,255,255,.58); font: 400 8px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
	.city-sequence > i { color: #536164; font: 400 8px var(--mono); text-align: center; }
	.city-sequence > i::after { content: '→'; display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: var(--orange); font-size: 16px; }
	.osaka-feature { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; margin-top: 15px; }
	.osaka-feature > * { min-height: 390px; }
	.osaka-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: end; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.osaka-copy p { margin: 0 0 auto; color: var(--orange); font: 500 9px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; }
	.osaka-copy h3 { margin: 60px 0 18px; font: 600 clamp(29px, 3vw, 43px)/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
	.osaka-copy span { color: #859397; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; }
	.osaka-feature figure { margin: 0; overflow: hidden; background: #151d20; }
	.osaka-feature img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
	.osaka-feature figure:first-of-type img { object-position: 50% 38%; }
	.osaka-feature figure:last-of-type img { object-position: 50% 50%; }

	.ocean { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr .65fr; width: 100%; padding: 0; background: #071b27; }
	.ocean-image { position: relative; min-height: 760px; overflow: hidden; }
	.ocean-image::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 70%, #071b27); }
	.ocean-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
	.depth { position: absolute; z-index: 2; bottom: 26px; left: 32px; padding: 8px 10px; background: rgba(3,15,22,.78); color: var(--sky); font: 400 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .12em; }
	.ocean-copy { align-self: center; max-width: 520px; padding: 90px 70px 90px 30px; }
	.ocean-copy h2 em { color: var(--sky); }
	.ocean-copy .lead { margin: 35px 0 22px; color: #d1e4e8; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; }
	.ocean-copy > p:not(.chapter-index):not(.lead) { margin: 0; color: #7fa0a8; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; }
	.dive-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 15px; margin-top: 45px; padding-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(127,213,227,.22); }
	.dive-facts div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
	.dive-facts strong { color: var(--sky); font: 600 23px var(--display); }
	.dive-facts span { color: #66858d; font: 400 7px/1.4 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }

	.mexico { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: clamp(65px, 10vw, 160px); align-items: center; }
	.mexico-copy { max-width: 570px; }
	.mexico-copy h2 { margin-bottom: 38px; }
	.mexico figure { margin: 0; }
	.mexico figure img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 760px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 50%; }
	.mexico figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 13px; color: #667478; font: 400 8px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .12em; }

	.curiosity { padding: 140px max(48px, calc((100% - 1400px) / 2)); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }
	.curiosity-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .65fr 1.3fr .75fr; gap: 60px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 70px; }
	.curiosity-heading h2 { margin: 0; font: 600 clamp(45px, 5.5vw, 80px)/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.06em; }
	.curiosity-heading > p:last-child { margin: 0; color: #596164; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }
	.moment-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: 180px; gap: 15px; }
	.moment-grid figure { position: relative; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; background: #b9b4aa; }
	.moment-grid .wide { grid-column: 1 / 8; grid-row: 1 / 4; }
	.moment-grid .portrait { grid-column: span 5; grid-row: span 4; }
	.moment-grid .portrait:nth-child(3) { grid-column: 1 / 6; }
	.moment-grid .tall { grid-column: 6 / 13; grid-row: 4 / 8; }
	.moment-grid img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 700ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
